---
interface Props {
  lang: "en" | "ru";
}

const { lang = "en" } = Astro.props;

const dict = {
  en: {
    svgTitle: "The shutdown time budget must nest: preStop sleep of 5 seconds plus in-app drain of 15 to 25 seconds must fit inside terminationGracePeriodSeconds, or the kubelet sends SIGKILL, exit 137, mid-request",
    headline: "DRAIN MUST FIT THE GRACE PERIOD",
    sub: "preStop sleep + drain < terminationGracePeriodSeconds",
    top: "SIGTERM → ready=false (/ready 503) → server.close() + closeIdleConnections()",
    seg1: "preStop sleep 5",
    seg2: "in-app drain ~15–25 s",
    seg3: "margin",
    tick0: "0 · SIGTERM",
    tick5: "5 s",
    tick30: "30 s",
    tick40: "40 s",
    kill: "SIGKILL → exit 137",
    axisLabel: "time",
    foot1: "grace default 30 s · this budget 40 s: 5 + 15–25 must fit with margin",
    foot2: "idle keep-alive sockets pin server.close() — evict with closeIdleConnections()",
    caption:
      "terminationGracePeriodSeconds is the total budget from SIGTERM to SIGKILL. The preStop sleep of about five seconds plus the in-app drain of about fifteen to twenty-five seconds must fit inside it with margin — overrun it and the kubelet sends SIGKILL, exit 137, straight through in-flight requests.",
  },
  ru: {
    svgTitle: "Временной бюджет завершения должен вкладываться: preStop-sleep в 5 секунд плюс in-app слив в 15–25 секунд должны влезть в terminationGracePeriodSeconds, иначе kubelet шлёт SIGKILL, код 137, посреди запроса",
    headline: "СЛИВ ДОЛЖЕН ВЛЕЗТЬ В GRACE PERIOD",
    sub: "preStop-sleep + слив < terminationGracePeriodSeconds",
    top: "SIGTERM → ready=false (/ready 503) → server.close() + closeIdleConnections()",
    seg1: "preStop sleep 5",
    seg2: "in-app слив ~15–25 с",
    seg3: "запас",
    tick0: "0 · SIGTERM",
    tick5: "5 с",
    tick30: "30 с",
    tick40: "40 с",
    kill: "SIGKILL → код 137",
    axisLabel: "время",
    foot1: "дефолт grace 30 с · этот бюджет 40 с: 5 + 15–25 должны влезть с запасом",
    foot2: "простаивающие keep-alive-сокеты держат server.close() — выселяй через closeIdleConnections()",
    caption:
      "terminationGracePeriodSeconds — полный бюджет от SIGTERM до SIGKILL. PreStop-sleep около пяти секунд плюс in-app слив около пятнадцати–двадцати пяти секунд должны влезть в него с запасом — переберёшь, и kubelet шлёт SIGKILL, код 137, прямо сквозь запросы в полёте.",
  },
};

const t = dict[lang];
---

<figure data-lesson-visual class="my-6">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 800 420" role="img" font-family="var(--font-mono)">
    <title lang="en">{dict.en.svgTitle}</title>
    <title lang="ru">{dict.ru.svgTitle}</title>
    <defs>
      <marker id="nd12-go" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M 0 1 L 9 5 L 0 9" fill="none" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.6" />
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <text x="400" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="22" fill="var(--ink)">{t.headline}</text>
    <text x="400" y="58" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">{t.sub}</text>

    <text x="400" y="96" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.top}</text>

    <text x="120" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.seg1}</text>
    <text x="360" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.seg2}</text>
    <text x="640" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.seg3}</text>

    <rect x="80" y="150" width="80" height="44" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5" />
    <rect x="160" y="150" width="400" height="44" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <rect x="560" y="150" width="160" height="44" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--ink)" stroke-width="2" />

    <text x="80" y="218" text-anchor="start" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.tick0}</text>
    <text x="160" y="218" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.tick5}</text>
    <text x="560" y="218" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.tick30}</text>
    <text x="720" y="218" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.tick40}</text>

    <text x="720" y="244" text-anchor="end" font-size="11" fill="var(--accent)">{t.kill}</text>

    <text x="400" y="262" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.axisLabel}</text>
    <line x1="80" y1="270" x2="700" y2="270" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="1.6" marker-end="url(#nd12-go)" />

    <text x="400" y="312" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.foot1}</text>
    <text x="400" y="336" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.foot2}</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption style="text-align: center;">{t.caption}</figcaption>
</figure>
